        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Extended Lip Stainless Steel ANSI Strike Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nStandard ANSI Strike Plate. Normally used on commercial metal frame doors for <a href=\"/collections/commercial-lock-sets\"><b>Commercial Locks</b></a>. Package includes stainless steel strike plate with installation screws for use on either wood or metal doors and frames. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Don-Jo DJO-EST-1xx-630,  Extended Lip ANSI Door Strike Plates\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainles Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 2 ea. 12-24 x 3/4\" FH Combo Screw</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 7 Lengths:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>DJO-EST-115-630</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lip Extension Length: 1-1/2\" Lip</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<b>DJO-EST-158-630</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lip Extension Length: 1-5/8\" Lip</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<b>DJO-EST-175-630</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lip Extension Length: 1-3/4\" Lip</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<b>DJO-EST-102-630</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lip Extension Length: 2\" Lip</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<b>DJO-EST-125-630</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lip Extension Length: 2-1/2\" Lip</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<b>DJO-EST-103-630</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lip Extension Length: 3\" Lip</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>DJO-EST-104-630</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lip Extension Length: 4\" Lip</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually. </i>\r\n</p>",
